            <description><![CDATA[<p>A small update to how Stillread talks about licence keys.</p>
<ul>
<li>If a licence key can&#x27;t be activated because of a problem on our side, Stillread now says so plainly and points you to support, instead of suggesting the key was refunded or revoked</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
